{"book":"ecclesiastes","num":4,"verses":[{"en":"So I returned, and considered all the oppressions that are done under the sun: and behold the tears of such as were oppressed, and they had no comforter; and on the side of their oppressors there was power; but they had no comforter.","n":1,"sm":"Ona ou toe manatunatu lea i sauaga uma ua faia i lalo o le la; faauta foi i loimata o e ua sauaina, ua leai foi se na te faamafanafanaina i latou; ua lima malosi foi e na saua ia te i latou; a ua leai se na te faamafanafanaina i latou.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ona"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"toe"},{"en":"","sm":"manatunatu"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"sauaga"},{"en":"","sm":"uma"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"faia"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"lalo"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"la;"},{"en":"","sm":"faauta"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"loimata"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"sauaina,"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"leai"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"se"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"faamafanafanaina"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"latou;"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"lima"},{"en":"","sm":"malosi"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"saua"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"latou;"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"leai"},{"en":"","sm":"se"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"faamafanafanaina"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"latou."}]},{"en":"Wherefore I praised the dead which are already dead more than the living which are yet alive.","n":2,"sm":"Ona ou faamanuia ai lea ie ua oti, e ua oti anamua, e sili i e ola, o i latou o e ola mai nei.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ona"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"faamanuia"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"ie